A consumed nonce presented again is refused (the store is never rewound);
an envelope past its expiry window is refused. Restored tree: identical
refusals (GREEN = still refused).

Executable form: tests.test_auth_envelope
TestEnvelopeMintValidate.test_replayed_nonce_refused +
test_expired_envelope_refused + test_missing_replay_set_fails_closed.

